\f0\b \cf0 Contents:
\f1\b0 \
The repository contains the following files:\
\

\f0\b Data:\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 \
1. Data_eleSubset_PollSubset_R.csv\
\
This dataset contains 
\f0\b pollinator
\f1\b0  observations made in two time periods on Pikes Peak that meet the following criteria:\
- Observed pollinator was identified to species level\
- Pollinator species was observed in both the past and present\
- At least 3 individuals of the pollinator species were observed in each time period\
- In the present, the pollinator was observed between 2300 and 2900 meters of elevation\
\
\
Variables:\
Poll_spec: The species name of the observed pollinator species \
Poll_order: The name of the order the observed pollinator species belongs to\
Julian_day: The Julian day (day of the year) that the pollinator was observed\
Plant_spec: The species name of the plant the pollinator was observed on\
Freq: The frequency of the observed plant-pollinator interaction\
Period: The time period where an observation was made (2 levels: \'93Past\'94 and \'93Present\'94)\
\
2. Data_eleSubset_PlantSubset_R.csv\
\
This dataset contains 
\f0\b plant
\f1\b0  observations made in two time periods on Pikes Peak that meet the following criteria:\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 - Observed plant was identified to species level\
- Plant species was observed in both the past and present\
- At least 3 individuals of the plant species were observed in each time period\
- In the present, the plant was observed between 2300 and 2900 meters of elevation\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
Variables:\
